<title>SPAIN: Spain's CVNE starts trade at 5,010 ptas.</title>
<headline>Spain's CVNE starts trade at 5,010 ptas.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in winery Compania Vinicola del Norte (CVNE) started trade on the Spanish bourse on Thursday at 5,010 pesetas, dealers said.</p>
<p>This compared with the price set for the initial public offering for a 22.46 percent stake in the firm of 3,900 pesetas.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
